WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:06.880
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going&nbsp;
to explain a post apocalyptic drama film&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:15.920
called “Cargo”. Watch out and take care!
 
&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:19.760
At the start of the film, we&nbsp;
are introduced to a couple,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.760 --> 00:00:26.080
Andy and Kay, along with their one-year-old&nbsp;
daughter Rosie. In a world ravaged by a virus&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.080 --> 00:00:33.280
that turns people into zombies in 48 hours, they&nbsp;
seek refuge on a houseboat in rural Australia.
 
&nbsp;

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.880
While relocating to a safe place for the night,&nbsp;
Andy spots two children playing on the riverside.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:43.680
He waves at them and tries to talk with&nbsp;
them, but their father spots Andy and draws&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.680 --> 00:00:48.720
a revolver from his belt, compelling him&nbsp;
to continue on his way. The family is used&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:48.720 --> 00:00:53.840
to getting supplies from the sea as they are&nbsp;
too scared of travelling to the land. Later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:58.320
Kay mentions that their food supplies are running&nbsp;
out and that they should travel through land to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:04.480
get better supplies. However, Andy criticizes her&nbsp;
decision as he is scared of what lies on land.
 
&nbsp;

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.640
Afterward, Andy discovers an abandoned sailboat&nbsp;
on the riverbank, and goes out to inspect it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:16.080
While he collects some food and a bottle of&nbsp;
wine from inside, he hears some strange noises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:22.080
coming from within a door. Despite being curious,&nbsp;
Andy is unwilling to take any risks and retreats&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.080 --> 00:01:27.520
to his boat. He passes the captured goods over&nbsp;
to Kay, but she is skeptical about the food.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:32.480
Being the good husband that he is, Andy manages&nbsp;
to convince his wife that everything is fine.
 
&nbsp;

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.760
Later, Kay asks Andy to take a break and then&nbsp;
heads to the sailboat. The greed to salvage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:49.920
more supplies prompts her to enter the dangerous&nbsp;
yacht alone. Andy had left earlier after hearing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.680
thuds from a wall door, but Kay is completely&nbsp;
unaware of this. Soon, she gets pulled and bitten&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.840
by an unknown entity, most likely a zombie.
 
Andy's sleep is disturbed by Rosie's crying and he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.840 --> 00:02:07.280
goes in search of Kay. He notices some bloodstains&nbsp;
on the floor and finds Kay trying to keep blood&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:13.200
flow under control. She is inside the restroom and&nbsp;
has a bite mark on her knee. She then explores a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:18.320
rucksack that Andy had retrieved from the yacht&nbsp;
earlier. Kay wears a bracelet that counts down&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:18.320 --> 00:02:23.840
how much longer an infected has left, as well&nbsp;
as an infusion that mitigates the brain and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:30.080
allows an infected to transition into a zombie&nbsp;
painlessly. Andy and Kay discuss their objectives,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.080 --> 00:02:34.480
revealing Kay's vulnerabilities to the&nbsp;
family. After the emotional discussion,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.480 --> 00:02:39.760
the family finally makes the decision to leave&nbsp;
the houseboat and seek medical assistance. 
 
&nbsp;

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:44.960
In the next scene, Thoomi, a little Aboriginal&nbsp;
girl, is shown doodling in a sketchbook.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:44.960 --> 00:02:51.120
After leaving her house, she tosses a dead rabbit&nbsp;
into a hole. She suddenly hears gurgling noises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:56.320
and puts her hands over her ears. It seems&nbsp;
like she is trying to feed something.
 
&nbsp;

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:01.360
Later, Andy and Kay locate a car nearby. They&nbsp;
nearly dodge a zombie approaching them as&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.360 --> 00:03:06.960
they drive away. After some time driving,&nbsp;
they take a halt where Andy studies a map&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.960 --> 00:03:13.360
as Kay starts changing Rosie's diaper. Just then,&nbsp;
Kay drops on the floor vomiting blood all over.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:19.520
Andy jumps out of the car and swiftly calms&nbsp;
her down. Kay appears to be transforming into&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.520 --> 00:03:24.560
a zombie. On the other hand, Thoomi can be&nbsp;
seen throwing a snake into the hole again,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:29.680
but this time she hears no sound.
 
Elsewhere, Kay regains her consciousness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:35.120
and examines her wound, which is dripping&nbsp;
yellow sludge. She screams at Andy as she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:40.320
gets out of the car, outraged that he has been&nbsp;
trying to keep her zombie progress secret from&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:46.000
her. She's worried about infecting their baby&nbsp;
daughter. Despite his concerns, Andy calms her and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:51.760
persuades her to follow him. To prevent Kay from&nbsp;
making another escape, he smashes the doorknob.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:56.560
On the way, Andy gets distracted by a weird&nbsp;
looking guy on the road, which results in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.560 --> 00:04:03.920
the car crashing onto a tree. Hours later, Andy&nbsp;
regains consciousness and tries to wake Kay up,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:03.920 --> 00:04:10.400
but finds her already turned into a zombie. Her&nbsp;
lips and eyes are all filled with yellow pus. Andy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:16.240
is frightened and tries to escape with Rosie, but&nbsp;
gets bitten by her while attempting to do so. 
 
&nbsp;

00:04:16.240 --> 00:04:21.600
After some attempts, Andy manages to get out of&nbsp;
the car and applies one of the injections to Kay.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.600 --> 00:04:26.800
Before setting out towards the destination on&nbsp;
foot, he puts Kay’s timer bracelet on himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.800 --> 00:04:32.560
and straps Rosie to his back. The small girl&nbsp;
starts crying as she misses her mother but Andy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:38.240
quickly calms her down by applying Kay's perfume.&nbsp;
During a short stop for rest, Andy discovers the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:43.680
person who caused their accident. He identifies&nbsp;
him as a zombie and prepares to defend himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:48.960
Suddenly, Thoomi appears and attempts to&nbsp;
distract the zombie guy, who turns out to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:54.080
be her father. She requests Andy to remain&nbsp;
away from him and cuts her hand with a rock,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:58.880
which starts dripping blood. This seems to&nbsp;
attract her zombie father towards her. 
 
&nbsp;

00:04:58.880 --> 00:05:04.640
After some walking, Andy enters a school and&nbsp;
encounters a retired instructor named Etta.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.640 --> 00:05:10.080
She aids him in washing his wounds and informs him&nbsp;
that all of the Aboriginal people in the area have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.080 --> 00:05:15.040
left, including many of her former students.&nbsp;
She also requests him to spend the night at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:21.680
the school. Later, Andy notices a fire nearby&nbsp;
started by the Aboriginals and also a woman who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:27.920
is trying to contact Thoomi. At night, Andy gets&nbsp;
his first seizure because of the zombie effect.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:33.040
He begins to vomit blood and passes out.
 
The next morning, he wakes up and walks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:37.120
outside to meet Etta, who urges him&nbsp;
to look for Thoomi's father, Willie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:43.120
as he will look over Rosie. She then advices Andy&nbsp;
to be away from the Aboriginals as they murder&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:49.440
any zombies or infected who come near them. After&nbsp;
the conversation, Andy heads out once again.
 
&nbsp;

00:05:49.440 --> 00:05:54.320
On the way, Andy pauses at some ruins&nbsp;
to give Rosie water. As he rushes out,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.320 --> 00:05:59.200
he passes several zombies with their heads&nbsp;
buried in the ground. One of them rises and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.200 --> 00:06:04.480
starts pursuing him. Andy finds a car and tries&nbsp;
to steal it, but is stopped by a guy named Vic,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.480 --> 00:06:09.360
who protects him from the zombie who had been&nbsp;
following him. Vic is stuck beneath a tank,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:14.720
and he hands up the car keys to Andy in exchange&nbsp;
for a promise that he will save him first.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:14.720 --> 00:06:19.040
Andy agrees right away, and after removing&nbsp;
the weight that had been squeezing Vic ,he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:24.240
starts the car. The two then rush into their&nbsp;
car and race away, leaving the zombies.
 
&nbsp;

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:30.160
In the following scene, Vic drives Andy to his&nbsp;
sanctuary, which was originally a gas plant&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:36.880
outpost, where he used to work. Lorraine, Vic's&nbsp;
wife, is quietly surprised to meet Andy. Vic then&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:36.880 --> 00:06:42.000
instructs Andy to leave Rosie with Lorraine so&nbsp;
the two men can work together for hunting some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:42.000 --> 00:06:47.520
food and killing zombies. Vic believes that once&nbsp;
the country is back to normal, people will crave&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:47.520 --> 00:06:52.880
money again, thus his job is killing groups&nbsp;
of zombies and seizing their belongings.
 
&nbsp;

00:06:53.440 --> 00:06:58.400
Vic baits the zombies by putting healthy,&nbsp;
live individuals in cages. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.400 --> 00:07:04.720
Andy notices Vic holding Thoomi hostage inside&nbsp;
a cage, and gets irritated. Inside the shelter,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:08.960
while Lorraine is looking after Rosie and&nbsp;
attempting to cheer her up, she discovers&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:14.240
some yellow slime-like thing on her belly. 
 
Vic and Andy, on the other hand, move to a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:21.040
different cage. He uses organs, a radio, and blood&nbsp;
to attract zombies, which makes Andy doubt himself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:26.320
for a bit. After the boys return to the shelter,&nbsp;
Lorraine discusses cleaning up Rosie briefly.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:31.920
As Andy plays with his daughter before putting her&nbsp;
in a temporary cradle, his hand starts to twitch.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:31.920 --> 00:07:37.120
Seeing himself in this terrible condition and&nbsp;
knowing that Rosie is in safe hands, Andy comes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:43.120
outside the shelter to a lonely place and tries&nbsp;
to kill himself. But before he is able to do so,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:48.080
Lorraine confronts him and explains that&nbsp;
she is not Vic's wife and that Vic rescued&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:54.080
himself by allowing her husband and other gas&nbsp;
plant workers to die. As they are conversing,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:58.720
Vic appears out of nowhere and uses the&nbsp;
butt of his rifle to knock Andy down. 
 
&nbsp;

00:07:58.720 --> 00:08:03.520
When Andy wakes up, he finds himself in the&nbsp;
same cage as Thoomi. Andy then asks Thoomi&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.520 --> 00:08:09.520
to help him to get out of the cage. He devises a&nbsp;
strategy in which he connects raw guts to a rope,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:14.800
attracting a swarm of zombies. When the zombies&nbsp;
begin to tug on the rope, the door opens,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:19.920
allowing the two to flee. They safely return to&nbsp;
the shelter and persuade Lorraine to come along&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:25.440
with them. As they try to escape, Vic emerges and&nbsp;
starts shooting at them. Lorraines shows herself&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:25.440 --> 00:08:30.480
and attempts to stop him but it's too late&nbsp;
as Vic accidentally shoots her dead.
 
&nbsp;

00:08:30.480 --> 00:08:35.600
Andy follows Thoomi to the cage he saw before,&nbsp;
but the man inside has vanished. They manage&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.600 --> 00:08:41.040
to avoid Vic's pursuit and spend the night in a&nbsp;
tiny gorge. After freeing each other's chains,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:47.280
they sleep freely. Later at night, Thoomi wakes&nbsp;
up to heavy breathing and hides with Rosie as Andy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:52.560
rubs his face against blood on the wall.
 
The next morning, Andy and Thoomi have a talk&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:57.680
regarding her father's well-being. After Andy&nbsp;
points out that her father may never get well,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.680 --> 00:09:03.600
Thoomi storms away in anger. Just then, Thoomi&nbsp;
discovers her father straddling on the tree,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:10.160
dead. Andy arrives to console Thoomi, but fails&nbsp;
and swiftly departs. Soon, he has another nervous&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:15.440
breakdown after he finds out that he has very&nbsp;
little time left before he completely transforms&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:15.440 --> 00:09:21.120
into a zombie. After some time, he attempts to&nbsp;
bury his head in the earth like other zombies.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.120 --> 00:09:26.880
Thoomi stands by the tree, heartbroken, but&nbsp;
hears Rosie's cry and rushes to her aid. When&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.880 --> 00:09:32.480
Andy wakes up, he is surprised by Thoomi, who has&nbsp;
chosen to assist him in reaching the river.
 
&nbsp;

00:09:32.480 --> 00:09:37.760
In the next scene, they travel by motorboat to&nbsp;
the campground where Andy last saw the family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.760 --> 00:09:43.920
playing. They find an RV and investigate it but&nbsp;
find it empty. After that, Andy and Rosie search&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:43.920 --> 00:09:49.200
for the family, while Thoomi stays behind. Andy&nbsp;
finally meets the father, but finds out that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:55.040
has been infected from a zombie attack. For the&nbsp;
second time, the man shows Andy his loaded rifle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:55.040 --> 00:10:00.640
The man then reveals that there are six bullets in&nbsp;
there, two of which Andy may retain after he uses&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:00.640 --> 00:10:06.240
the rest on himself and his family. Andy tries&nbsp;
to persuade the man from finishing his family,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:11.440
but he fails. While Andy is leaving, four&nbsp;
gunshots can be heard in the distance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:16.800
He flinches at the sound of each of them. After&nbsp;
the whole family is dead, Andy takes the gun and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:22.240
considers whether or not to shoot himself. As Andy&nbsp;
is contemplating, Thoomi appears out of nowhere,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:27.520
announcing that she is ready to return to her&nbsp;
home. She also suggests Andy follow her so&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:27.520 --> 00:10:32.240
that he can leave Rosie with the aboriginals.&nbsp;
Following this, they set out together to look&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:32.240 --> 00:10:36.240
for smoke coming from a nearby hill.
 
As they pass through the train tunnel,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.680
Vic emerges in front of them. Thoomi hides&nbsp;
with Rosie inside a parked truck on the tracks&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:47.520
as Andy attempts to distract Vic. Andy shoots&nbsp;
rounds but misses each time as the two guys&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:47.520 --> 00:10:53.840
become more violent. Vic emerges from the shadows&nbsp;
after the brawl and drags Thoomi from the truck.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:53.840 --> 00:11:00.480
He then knocks her head on the rails. While Thoomi&nbsp;
lies in agony, Vic grabs hold of Rosie. A limping&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:06.400
Andy gets up to check on Thoomi, who is still&nbsp;
alive. He then finds Vic cradling with Rosie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.400 --> 00:11:12.800
He sits near Vic and demands his daughter back.&nbsp;
At first Vic refuses but he ultimately returns&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.800 --> 00:11:18.240
the child while mourning Lorraine's untimely&nbsp;
death. The trio then continue their journey.
 
&nbsp;

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:23.360
Continuing their way towards the destination,&nbsp;
Andy begins to transform into a zombie.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:23.360 --> 00:11:28.320
With very little time left, Andy begs&nbsp;
Thoomi to promise to look for Rosie,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:34.000
with whom he exchanges a goodbye. Fearing that&nbsp;
he might harm someone, Andy covers his mouth with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:39.920
a guard. He then starts securing his wrists, and&nbsp;
wraps the meat from earlier on a stick. Suddenly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:46.160
his eyelashes are sealed shut and he passes&nbsp;
out. Andy has now turned into a zombie and all&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:51.680
his emotions have died. Despite this, he still&nbsp;
carries the two children on his back, as he is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:57.280
drawn in by the chunk of flesh on the stick.
 
Eventually, they arrive at the Aboroginal's camp.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:57.280 --> 00:12:02.800
The warriors seize Andy, while Thoomi and Rosie&nbsp;
are hailed by her mother. One of the warriors is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:02.800 --> 00:12:08.400
about to strike Andy with his spear but Thoomi&nbsp;
intervenes. She then takes Kay's perfume bottle&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:08.400 --> 00:12:13.360
and gives it one final spritz. Andy is briefly&nbsp;
brought back to awareness by the aroma,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:13.360 --> 00:12:18.960
which reminds him that Rosie is now in safe hands.&nbsp;
Following that, Thoomi ultimately allows the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:24.000
warrior to put Andy out of his misery.
 
In the final scene, The Aboriginal people&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:29.120
are shown traveling to a shelter, where they are&nbsp;
received warmly by several members of their tribe.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:33.600
Rosie is being examined by Thoomi and her&nbsp;
mother when they see the words Thank You&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:38.720
scrawled in white paint on her tummy. 
 
